snippet:
New config (defaults):
rollout:
  headroom_guardrail:
    enabled: false
    mode: warn
    min_headroom_pct: 0.15
    min_spare_replicas: 1

Stage transition behavior (pseudo):
if guardrail.enabled {
  res := HeadroomCheck(poolSnapshot, targetWeight)
  if res.snapshotStale { hold("INSUFFICIENT_HEADROOM", "snapshot_stale") }
  if res.mode == "warn" { emitWarn(res) }
  if res.mode == "block" && !res.passes { hold("INSUFFICIENT_HEADROOM", res.reason) }
}
applyStageWeight()
